1
00:00:08,629 --> 00:00:11,102
♪Amid the sea of faces♪

2
00:00:11,138 --> 00:00:14,086
♪Our eyes meet by chance♪

3
00:00:14,281 --> 00:00:17,459
♪Through the restless years♪

4
00:00:17,554 --> 00:00:20,926
♪Time suddenly slows♪

5
00:00:21,828 --> 00:00:23,999
♪No vows need be made♪

6
00:00:24,037 --> 00:00:26,726
♪Though seas and mountains lie ahead♪

7
00:00:27,542 --> 00:00:29,589
♪One glance says it all♪

8
00:00:29,609 --> 00:00:33,246
♪Beyond a thousand words♪

9
00:00:34,158 --> 00:00:37,431
♪With you by my side♪

10
00:00:37,464 --> 00:00:40,717
♪I dare brave a thousand trials♪

11
00:00:40,743 --> 00:00:43,834
♪Though mist may veil the road ahead♪

12
00:00:43,882 --> 00:00:47,384
♪Hand in hand, no counting years♪

13
00:00:47,401 --> 00:00:50,571
♪With you by my side♪

14
00:00:50,598 --> 00:00:54,246
♪No need to speak my heart at length♪

15
00:00:54,289 --> 00:00:57,249
♪As rivers and mountains change♪

16
00:00:57,306 --> 00:00:59,390
♪May we remain together♪

17
00:00:59,411 --> 00:01:01,966
♪From dawn to dusk♪

18
00:01:01,966 --> 00:01:07,000
=Daughter of a Concubine=

19
00:01:07,000 --> 00:01:10,000
=Episode 8=

20
00:01:12,000 --> 00:01:12,760
Mother!

21
00:01:12,879 --> 00:01:13,640
Madam!

22
00:01:13,719 --> 00:01:14,760
Mother, are you all right?

23
00:01:27,439 --> 00:01:28,519
Aunt.

24
00:01:28,519 --> 00:01:29,719
Are you going to kill me?

25
00:01:30,000 --> 00:01:31,239
You're not blind?

26
00:01:32,680 --> 00:01:33,439
What are you doing?

27
00:01:33,439 --> 00:01:34,439
Let go of my mother!

28
00:01:34,879 --> 00:01:35,959
I am blind.

29
00:01:36,319 --> 00:01:38,400
But I can still take you down with me.

30
00:01:38,760 --> 00:01:40,000
If you want to kill me,

31
00:01:40,040 --> 00:01:40,840
you won't live either.

32
00:01:40,840 --> 00:01:41,959
I don't want to kill you.

33
00:01:42,120 --> 00:01:43,920
I just have a few questions.

34
00:01:45,920 --> 00:01:47,239
First question.

35
00:01:47,239 --> 00:01:48,359
Where is Nanny Zhao?

36
00:01:49,439 --> 00:01:50,560
I don't know.

37
00:01:53,480 --> 00:01:54,239
She...

38
00:01:54,359 --> 00:01:55,159
She's fine.

39
00:01:55,920 --> 00:01:57,519
She's just been locked up.

40
00:01:57,879 --> 00:01:58,640
Good.

41
00:01:59,239 --> 00:02:00,599
Second question.

42
00:02:00,920 --> 00:02:03,959
Did you frame Third Aunt
all those years ago?

43
00:02:04,000 --> 00:02:06,120
Were you the one who killed Old Master?

44
00:02:06,760 --> 00:02:08,879
Why do you ask me this now?

45
00:02:09,159 --> 00:02:10,599
Zhou Lanxin.

46
00:02:10,599 --> 00:02:12,319
I understand you hate me.

47
00:02:12,439 --> 00:02:14,479
But you framed Third Aunt and

48
00:02:14,479 --> 00:02:15,479
killed Old Master.

49
00:02:15,479 --> 00:02:16,280
You shouldn't have.

50
00:02:16,280 --> 00:02:18,240
And now you've killed my mother.

51
00:02:18,240 --> 00:02:19,800
That's unforgivable!

52
00:02:21,919 --> 00:02:23,840
Old Master never liked me anyway!

53
00:02:24,120 --> 00:02:25,680
I only wish he'd died sooner!

54
00:02:25,759 --> 00:02:26,759
What about my mother?

55
00:02:27,000 --> 00:02:29,080
Because she helped Third Aunt
clear her name,

56
00:02:29,080 --> 00:02:30,639
you had to silence her?

57
00:02:30,639 --> 00:02:32,319
You vicious madwoman!

58
00:02:32,319 --> 00:02:33,759
You want to run wild and bite.

59
00:02:33,840 --> 00:02:35,199
Look whose house is this!

60
00:02:35,199 --> 00:02:37,120
Xia Yunyi, let go of my mother!

61
00:02:37,479 --> 00:02:39,039
Did you hear me?

62
00:02:39,479 --> 00:02:40,080
Mother!

63
00:02:40,080 --> 00:02:40,719
Are you okay?

64
00:02:40,719 --> 00:02:41,240
Go, quickly!

65
00:02:41,560 --> 00:02:42,159
Mother.

66
00:02:42,159 --> 00:02:42,840
Madam.

67
00:02:43,000 --> 00:02:43,800
Sister.

68
00:02:45,199 --> 00:02:46,120
Help me!

69
00:02:46,120 --> 00:02:46,840
Sister.

70
00:02:47,080 --> 00:02:48,159
Are you okay?

71
00:02:48,159 --> 00:02:48,960
Help me!

72
00:02:49,199 --> 00:02:50,080
I'm fine.

73
00:02:50,319 --> 00:02:51,120
Wait a moment.

74
00:02:51,919 --> 00:02:52,479
Mother.

75
00:02:53,400 --> 00:02:54,120
Help...

76
00:02:56,639 --> 00:02:58,120
Sister, grab this.

77
00:02:58,479 --> 00:02:59,759
The rope's right above you.

78
00:02:59,759 --> 00:03:01,039
Stand up and you can reach it.

79
00:03:03,599 --> 00:03:05,120
Mother, grab the rope.

80
00:03:05,120 --> 00:03:06,240
I'll pull you up.

81
00:03:12,639 --> 00:03:13,479
Hold tight!

82
00:03:14,639 --> 00:03:15,680
Hang in there, Mother.

83
00:03:17,360 --> 00:03:18,360
- Sister.
- Mother.

84
00:03:18,360 --> 00:03:19,280
Are you okay, Mother?

85
00:03:19,639 --> 00:03:21,039
- Madam...
- You're hurt.

86
00:03:22,159 --> 00:03:22,960
I'm fine.

87
00:03:22,960 --> 00:03:24,080
Just a scratch.

88
00:03:24,080 --> 00:03:24,879
Nothing serious.

89
00:03:25,120 --> 00:03:26,000
What brings you here?

90
00:03:26,159 --> 00:03:26,879
I was worried.

91
00:03:26,879 --> 00:03:28,199
So I went to get First Aunt.

92
00:03:29,599 --> 00:03:30,800
She's here too.

93
00:03:32,439 --> 00:03:33,400
What happened?

94
00:03:33,439 --> 00:03:34,199
Sister.

95
00:03:34,199 --> 00:03:35,919
Xia Yunyi pushed me into the well.

96
00:03:35,919 --> 00:03:37,000
She tried to kill me!

97
00:03:37,000 --> 00:03:37,360
Right!

98
00:03:37,360 --> 00:03:38,319
I saw it myself.

99
00:03:38,319 --> 00:03:39,800
She pushed my mother down the well.

100
00:03:40,759 --> 00:03:41,560
That's right.

101
00:03:41,800 --> 00:03:42,960
I saw it too.

102
00:03:42,960 --> 00:03:44,199
What nonsense are you talking?

103
00:03:44,439 --> 00:03:45,240
Aunt.

104
00:03:45,560 --> 00:03:48,039
Second Aunt must have lured
sister to the well

105
00:03:48,039 --> 00:03:49,280
and tried to push her in.

106
00:03:49,319 --> 00:03:51,000
Sister only grabbed her out of instinct.

107
00:03:51,000 --> 00:03:52,840
That's why they both fell in.

108
00:03:52,840 --> 00:03:53,919
You liar!

109
00:03:56,240 --> 00:03:57,120
Miss Yunyi...

110
00:03:57,120 --> 00:03:58,000
Nanny Zhao.

111
00:03:58,240 --> 00:03:59,039
Miss Yunyi.

112
00:03:59,639 --> 00:04:04,159
I thought I'd never see you again.

113
00:04:04,759 --> 00:04:05,759
Are you all right?

114
00:04:05,960 --> 00:04:06,800
I'm fine.

115
00:04:10,319 --> 00:04:11,400
Thank you, Mother.

116
00:04:13,120 --> 00:04:14,280
Sister.

117
00:04:14,599 --> 00:04:16,160
You had Nanny Zhao seized,

118
00:04:16,519 --> 00:04:18,759
then lured Xia Yunyi to the well.

119
00:04:19,040 --> 00:04:20,360
Do you admit to it?

120
00:04:21,560 --> 00:04:22,399
I witnessed it myself.

121
00:04:22,680 --> 00:04:23,720
Will you still deny it?

122
00:04:26,480 --> 00:04:27,360
Sister.

123
00:04:28,079 --> 00:04:30,079
I'll let today slide.

124
00:04:30,079 --> 00:04:31,519
Go back and rest.

125
00:04:31,959 --> 00:04:33,600
But if this happens again,

126
00:04:33,720 --> 00:04:35,319
I'll report you to Old Madam.

127
00:04:38,399 --> 00:04:39,199
Mother.

128
00:04:39,759 --> 00:04:41,279
We should leave.

129
00:04:48,399 --> 00:04:49,279
Easy, Mother.

130
00:04:50,399 --> 00:04:51,079
Take it slow.

131
00:04:53,399 --> 00:04:54,600
Thank you, Aunt.

132
00:04:54,879 --> 00:04:56,000
Thank you, Mother.

133
00:04:56,000 --> 00:04:56,800
Go back, then.

134
00:04:59,279 --> 00:05:00,399
Miss Yunyi.

135
00:05:02,600 --> 00:05:03,519
Third Miss.

136
00:05:03,519 --> 00:05:05,399
You've become much sharper.

137
00:05:06,279 --> 00:05:07,879
If big brother were here today,

138
00:05:08,920 --> 00:05:10,439
you wouldn't be in such a mess.

139
00:05:23,879 --> 00:05:25,879
(Old Master never liked me anyway!)

140
00:05:26,240 --> 00:05:27,879
(I only wish he'd died sooner!)

141
00:05:29,360 --> 00:05:31,480
(What Zhou Lanxin said in the well)

142
00:05:31,600 --> 00:05:33,399
(sounded more like spite.)

143
00:05:34,199 --> 00:05:35,800
(She's vicious and cruel,)

144
00:05:35,959 --> 00:05:37,319
(but reckless.)

145
00:05:37,839 --> 00:05:39,959
(She's not the type
to play the whole board.)

146
00:05:41,439 --> 00:05:44,759
(So who's really behind all this?)

147
00:05:50,000 --> 00:05:51,240
Whoever it is,

148
00:05:53,040 --> 00:05:54,680
I'll find out.

149
00:06:38,036 --> 00:06:40,280
♪Amid the sea of faces♪

150
00:06:40,545 --> 00:06:43,160
♪Our eyes meet by chance♪

151
00:06:43,688 --> 00:06:46,520
♪Through the restless years♪

152
00:06:47,560 --> 00:06:48,639
Your eyes...

153
00:06:48,647 --> 00:06:50,000
♪Time suddenly slows♪

154
00:06:51,480 --> 00:06:53,040
I've been able to see all along.

155
00:06:53,444 --> 00:06:55,800
♪Though seas and mountains lie ahead♪

156
00:06:56,949 --> 00:06:58,880
♪One glance says it all♪

157
00:06:59,016 --> 00:07:02,320
♪Beyond a thousand words♪

158
00:07:03,565 --> 00:07:06,720
♪With you by my side♪

159
00:07:06,951 --> 00:07:09,840
♪I dare brave a thousand trials♪

160
00:07:10,217 --> 00:07:13,120
♪Though mist may veil the road ahead♪

161
00:07:13,289 --> 00:07:16,520
♪Hand in hand, no counting years♪

162
00:07:16,808 --> 00:07:19,760
♪With you by my side♪

163
00:07:20,005 --> 00:07:23,320
♪No need to speak my heart at length♪

164
00:07:23,696 --> 00:07:25,959
♪As rivers and mountains change♪

165
00:07:25,959 --> 00:07:26,800
Does it hurt?

166
00:07:26,800 --> 00:07:28,800
♪May we remain together♪

167
00:07:28,818 --> 00:07:32,960
♪From dawn to dusk♪

168
00:07:44,279 --> 00:07:45,800
How did you get so badly hurt?

169
00:07:46,560 --> 00:07:47,879
Someone knew what I was looking into.

170
00:07:49,040 --> 00:07:50,279
They knew where I was headed

171
00:07:50,399 --> 00:07:51,560
and set an ambush in advance.

172
00:07:52,600 --> 00:07:54,160
They weren't ordinary assassins.

173
00:07:58,839 --> 00:07:59,680
Let me.

174
00:08:00,734 --> 00:08:03,040
♪Amid the sea of faces♪

175
00:08:03,249 --> 00:08:04,503
♪Our eyes meet by chance♪

176
00:08:04,519 --> 00:08:05,319
Your wound...

177
00:08:06,350 --> 00:08:07,423
♪Through the restless years♪

178
00:08:07,439 --> 00:08:08,959
Just a scratch.

179
00:08:09,759 --> 00:08:12,760
♪Time suddenly slows♪

180
00:08:14,042 --> 00:08:16,200
♪No vows need be made♪

181
00:08:16,240 --> 00:08:19,280
♪Though seas and mountains lie ahead♪

182
00:08:19,745 --> 00:08:21,640
♪One glance says it all♪

183
00:08:21,879 --> 00:08:25,880
♪Beyond a thousand words♪

184
00:08:26,361 --> 00:08:29,480
♪With you by my side♪

185
00:08:29,747 --> 00:08:32,600
♪I dare brave a thousand trials♪

186
00:08:33,013 --> 00:08:35,880
♪Though mist may veil the road ahead♪

187
00:08:36,146 --> 00:08:39,280
♪Hand in hand, no counting years♪

188
00:08:39,604 --> 00:08:42,520
♪With you by my side♪

189
00:08:42,801 --> 00:08:46,080
♪No need to speak my heart at length♪

190
00:08:46,520 --> 00:08:48,720
♪As rivers and mountains change♪

191
00:08:48,720 --> 00:08:50,240
How did you know I hate bitter medicine?

192
00:08:50,240 --> 00:08:51,279
♪May we remain together♪

193
00:08:51,279 --> 00:08:54,360
Qin Jun told me
on the day of my home visit.

194
00:08:54,360 --> 00:08:56,973
♪From dawn to dusk♪

195
00:08:57,000 --> 00:08:57,879
Xia Yunyi.

196
00:08:59,080 --> 00:09:00,639
You're quite a character.

197
00:09:02,480 --> 00:09:04,600
Is that a compliment?

198
00:09:20,080 --> 00:09:20,879
How is it?

199
00:09:23,320 --> 00:09:24,960
It won't kill me. Don't worry.

200
00:09:28,559 --> 00:09:30,480
Why are you all so badly injured?

201
00:10:03,919 --> 00:10:04,639
Oh, right.

202
00:10:05,759 --> 00:10:07,720
I found this on one of the assassins.

203
00:10:07,720 --> 00:10:08,679
Most of the letter

204
00:10:08,679 --> 00:10:09,399
was burned.

205
00:10:09,480 --> 00:10:10,320
Only this much is left.

206
00:10:10,320 --> 00:10:12,679
But the seal bears
the Cheng family mark.

207
00:10:16,240 --> 00:10:17,639
Madam, your eyes...

208
00:10:21,559 --> 00:10:22,519
They're healed.

209
00:10:29,032 --> 00:10:30,760
(Cheng)

210
00:10:33,799 --> 00:10:36,240
Only a few people in the Cheng family

211
00:10:38,000 --> 00:10:38,879
could use this seal.

212
00:10:41,039 --> 00:10:42,639
The killer you want

213
00:10:43,200 --> 00:10:44,399
and my target

214
00:10:44,399 --> 00:10:45,919
who killed my mother

215
00:10:46,399 --> 00:10:47,799
may be the same person.

216
00:10:49,919 --> 00:10:51,480
My mother knew something,

217
00:10:51,879 --> 00:10:53,159
That's why she was killed.

218
00:10:53,799 --> 00:10:55,000
Whatever you're investigating,

219
00:10:55,080 --> 00:10:56,639
they want you dead for it.

220
00:10:58,720 --> 00:11:00,039
The same person.

221
00:11:01,080 --> 00:11:02,279
The same scheme.

222
00:11:07,639 --> 00:11:08,440
All right.

223
00:11:09,240 --> 00:11:10,399
From this day forward,

224
00:11:11,759 --> 00:11:13,080
we share information,

225
00:11:13,360 --> 00:11:14,320
and we move together.

226
00:11:14,720 --> 00:11:15,600
You investigate the inner household,

227
00:11:16,000 --> 00:11:17,000
and I'll look into the affairs outside.

228
00:11:22,000 --> 00:11:22,919
Deal.

229
00:11:22,919 --> 00:11:23,720
Young General.

230
00:11:27,639 --> 00:11:28,480
General, Madam.

231
00:11:28,480 --> 00:11:29,360
My wounds haven't healed.

232
00:11:29,360 --> 00:11:31,200
I'll go rest.

233
00:11:37,639 --> 00:11:38,919
Young General.

234
00:11:38,919 --> 00:11:40,480
You can let go of my hand now.

235
00:11:59,840 --> 00:12:01,120
General.

236
00:12:01,120 --> 00:12:02,919
I made you fish soup.

237
00:12:02,919 --> 00:12:03,799
It'll help you recover.

238
00:12:03,919 --> 00:12:04,759
No need.

239
00:12:09,120 --> 00:12:09,919
Get out.

240
00:12:16,399 --> 00:12:17,200
Yes.

241
00:12:25,120 --> 00:12:26,480
(Cheng Mingzhi.)

242
00:12:27,080 --> 00:12:28,879
(I've served you for five years.)

243
00:12:29,320 --> 00:12:31,240
(You never once looked at me.)

244
00:12:31,480 --> 00:12:33,679
(But you protect that blind woman
at every turn.)

245
00:12:34,360 --> 00:12:35,639
(Why?)

246
00:12:56,760 --> 00:13:02,127
♪Let the past be buried in the wind♪

247
00:13:03,586 --> 00:13:08,167
♪Perhaps the waning moon knows my pain♪

248
00:13:08,637 --> 00:13:12,557
♪It sees the old tenderness
all come to nothing♪

249
00:13:12,631 --> 00:13:15,847
♪How many regrets haunt this world♪

250
00:13:15,869 --> 00:13:21,967
♪By the window, whose dreams flicker
by the dying candle♪

251
00:13:24,213 --> 00:13:28,567
♪Things remain, you're gone,
and I'm still dazed♪

252
00:13:29,746 --> 00:13:31,927
♪The sandstorm in my eyes♪

253
00:13:31,947 --> 00:13:35,287
♪Turns to a blade's edge♪
(Cheng Residence)

254
00:13:36,617 --> 00:13:38,287
♪Cutting through old years♪

255
00:13:38,348 --> 00:13:39,874
♪We can never embrace again♪

256
00:13:39,890 --> 00:13:45,087
♪If rain has tears,
wash away the dust of fate♪

257
00:13:45,222 --> 00:13:46,820
♪By lamplight, I turn the page♪

258
00:13:46,830 --> 00:13:49,840
♪The ink dries, and there you are♪

259
00:13:49,889 --> 00:13:51,647
♪Gone to ash in a flash♪

260
00:13:51,680 --> 00:13:53,367
♪Like a blade through my heart♪

261
00:13:53,389 --> 00:13:56,840
♪Too late to pull away♪

262
00:13:56,862 --> 00:13:59,387
♪The song ends, and all have gone♪

263
00:13:59,418 --> 00:14:03,647
♪Now we must part♪

264
00:14:03,686 --> 00:14:07,181
♪Flowers burn the ground,
yet vows are held so lightly♪

265
00:14:07,192 --> 00:14:10,647
♪The song ends.
Where shall I seek you in dreams♪

266
00:14:10,929 --> 00:14:12,713
♪By the window, a dying candle♪

267
00:14:12,756 --> 00:14:17,887
♪Whose shadow do I yearn for♪
